{% comment %}
  Phase 1 ships the full layout only.

  A transit board is a dense list — the debug markup alone prints several
  lines per departure — and the smaller layouts would need their own row
  budget and their own truncation rules rather than a scaled copy of this
  one. That is a phase 2 design decision, so these say so instead of
  rendering a cramped board that looks broken.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="view view--full">
  <div class="layout">
    <div class="content">
      <span class="title">NYC Transit</span>
      <span class="description">Use the full-screen layout</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
